WEBVTT

00:10:29.871 --> 00:10:33.954
prescreening tools and technology that
just siphoned me or filtered me out.

00:10:34.579 --> 00:10:37.162
I just wasn't even passing those
checks and balances.

00:10:37.996 --> 00:10:40.329
Remember, I dropped out of
college to go do this.

00:10:40.787 --> 00:10:44.871
I just knew that I could do that better
than anybody stepping out of

00:10:44.871 --> 00:10:46.662
a college with a communications degree.

00:10:47.954 --> 00:10:50.121
When you faced a headwind,
you need support.

00:10:50.787 --> 00:10:54.371
If you're like most people, your instinct
is to reach out to your strong ties,

00:10:54.871 --> 00:10:57.204
the people you know well and
trust to have your back.

00:10:57.954 --> 00:11:01.329
But research has shown that you're more
likely to get a job through weak ties.